    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d136-a2">

                <pb facs="0290" n="190" sameAs="frus:frus1880/pg190"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 3 in No. 523.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Tsung-li Yamên to the foreign
                    representatives</hi>.</head>
                <p>(Informal.)</p>
                <p>This office some time since transmitted to the representatives of China abroad a
                    memorandum in which was set forth its understanding of the treaties.</p>
                <pb facs="0291" n="191" xml:id="pg191"/>
                <p>I have now the honor to hand to your excellency herewith a copy of this
                    memorandum, in Chinese and foreign text, and beg your excellency to give it your
                    consideration.</p>
                <p>Cards and compliments.</p>
                <closer><dateline rendition="#float-left"><date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1879-11-29">November 29, 1879</date>,</dateline></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>The foreign office to the foreign representatives.</p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
